# An allow-list: the build context carries only what the host image is built from (ADR-1178). Everything else — .git,
# tests, docs, local settings, and build outputs — never reaches the Docker daemon.
#
# A file that a root build file imports must be re-admitted here too, as build/ProjectTemplate.props and the files it
# imports are. The Definition of Done does not build the image; only the Host image check finds a missing one.
*

!.editorconfig
!BannedSymbols.txt
!BannedSymbols.Encoding.txt
!build/ProjectTemplate.props
!build/ProjectTemplate.globalconfig
!build/ProjectTemplate.Tests.globalconfig
!build/BannedSymbols.txt
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Build.targets
!Directory.Packages.props
!global.json
!nuget.config
!version.json
!src/

# Build outputs and local state inside the allowed tree.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.turbo/
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/*.user
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/launchSettings.json
**/Dockerfile
